        <mxCell id="krVF8poIIhshtyXyTykB-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;The Extractor Agent&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Input: 8K, 14A, Form4, 10Ks, and last few 10Q ,&amp;nbsp;Investor Presentation Decks&amp;nbsp;for the last 10 years (not earning transcripts here - hard to get)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Action: give non-opinionated parsing, focus only on chapters related to Business, Risk Factors, Revenue and Cost structure, Financial Statements, R&amp;amp;D, Directors and Executives, Compensation, and skip everything else unrelated to these.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Output: Markdown containing agent-consumable data&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Style: non deep research, focus on input documents.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
